I know what the outliers are.

631
00:35:33,150 --> 00:35:40,370
我会基于这些基本面制定某个策略。同时，我也了解技术面的格局。
And I base a certain... I create a certain strategy based on those fundamentals. Equally, I know the technical landscape.

633
00:35:40,990 --> 00:35:43,590
对吧？所以我会去观察他们可能突破的位置,
Okay? So I go and observe where they keep potential breakouts,

634
00:35:43,890 --> 00:35:49,290
他们守住的关键防线——是否有Delta，是否有技术面的机会？
where they hold levels—is there a delta, is there some opportunity in terms of technical aspects?

636
00:35:49,410 --> 00:35:51,210
所以我准备得非常充分。
So I prepare extremely well.

637
00:35:51,290 --> 00:35:54,070
这适用于每一个风险事件交易。
And that goes for every single risk event.

638
00:35:54,190 --> 00:35:57,010
对吧？如果你想精通这些，不能只会识别模式。
Okay? If you want to become good at them, you can’t just know the patterns.

